{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey to ancient Greece in The Last King, an immersive open world survival game. As a courageous warrior, you must navigate a war-ravaged land teeming with enemies, including Persians, barbarians, and untamed wilderness. Forge your own destiny as you build a formidable base, recruit a mighty army, and liberate Greek villages from the clutches of oppression.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:\t</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rebuild your kingdom</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/154de14b76773773a438a03f5ce68c51.poster.avif?t=1769336876\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/154de14b76773773a438a03f5ce68c51.webm?t=1769336876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/154de14b76773773a438a03f5ce68c51.mp4?t=1769336876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The great Persian force have destroyed you, your army, your morale and your kingdom. Rebuild your kingdom brick by brick and see the citizens growing once more.<br>Build resource gathering stations and create jobs in your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Against Fierce Foes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/138c7b3404d40c1b3fda1dbc367b279b.poster.avif?t=1769336876\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/138c7b3404d40c1b3fda1dbc367b279b.webm?t=1769336876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/138c7b3404d40c1b3fda1dbc367b279b.mp4?t=1769336876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in intense combat against a diverse range of enemies. From relentless Persian forces to brutal barbarian tribes, every encounter is a test of skill and strategy. Command your army with precision, employing a variety of tactics and formations to outmaneuver and overpower your adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit, Train, and Equip Your Army:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/ddb91c0b53d2d3c10d355140e7af1c3b.poster.avif?t=1769336876\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/ddb91c0b53d2d3c10d355140e7af1c3b.webm?t=1769336876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/ddb91c0b53d2d3c10d355140e7af1c3b.mp4?t=1769336876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Assemble a loyal band of warriors from different backgrounds and specialties. Recruit skilled soldiers, train them in the art of war, and equip them with powerful weapons and armor. Develop unique strategies to utilize their strengths and unleash devastating attacks on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Marching camps:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/ae81a777df5567bdd468b7426d5ee3a1.poster.avif?t=1769336876\" width=798 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/ae81a777df5567bdd468b7426d5ee3a1.webm?t=1769336876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/extras/ae81a777df5567bdd468b7426d5ee3a1.mp4?t=1769336876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Construct and fortify your own base, shaping it into a bastion of power and safety. Customize your defenses, establish resource production, and strategize to withstand enemy assaults. Your base is the heart of your operations and the key to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and Thrive in an Open World: Explore a sprawling and dynamic open world, ravaged by war. Adapt to the harsh conditions of the wilderness, scavenge for resources, and master the art of survival in an unforgiving open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Greek Villages: Fight to liberate Greek villages that have fallen under enemy control. Storm enemy camps, destroy their strongholds, and rescue innocent civilians from oppression. Your heroic deeds will inspire hope and rally the people to your cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Your Way: Choose your preferred playstyle and specialize in a variety of combat roles. Master the art of the spear, wield a mighty sword, or rain death from afar as a skilled archer. Tailor your skills and abilities to suit your personal combat preferences and become a legendary warrior of ancient Greece.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Last King the fate of ancient Greece rests in your hands. Will you rise as a legendary hero, leading your army to victory and ensuring the survival of your people? Unleash your strategic prowess, harness your combat skills, and forge your own path in this immersive and challenging ancient Greek adventure.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Persian Camp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/f397185369557bbf2bfb8a3a5d5792b337e3ce39.jpg"},{"name":"Increase your army","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/eda0e5265fd78b53e8ffdb1747111b9392812a54.jpg"},{"name":"Clear District Part I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/74ff86d39af34eeca44beb48e937beaa28914ad8.jpg"},{"name":"Clear District Part II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/6dea6852b15fe1b07fa82e39a54edf4f2d9a071b.jpg"},{"name":"Help the healer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/a4a5d57c22d34f94bcfb4152e179fe596670a0b1.jpg"},{"name":"Fevered Pentekostys","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/0cb477cfe4d2ab38677765e1871f464ea552f44c.jpg"},{"name":"Cursed wounds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/c82aac94746fab52289cc6d9db7ecff9ff3e9f88.jpg"},{"name":"Sanctuary under siege","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/43261c6391b3be6a49a45294875b116904d519cc.jpg"},{"name":"Flesh and spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/cdc5561ab9223f5982aee7f52d0b62599b347247.jpg"},{"name":"Blessings of Athena","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2307400/c23f77bc060475e3f857c4bb2d16c0ff7a374c8e.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2307400?t=1769336876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769336876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769336876"